    <string name="about_text">Bitcoin Wallet\n
\n
A lightweight Bitcoin wallet built on BitcoinJ 0.17.1. The application is designed to keep wallet operations local, simple, and transparent.\n
\n
WALLET AND TRANSACTIONS\n
Your wallet data and transaction history are maintained locally by the BitcoinJ wallet engine. The application does not require a separate account or hosted wallet service.\n
\n
SECURITY AND BACKUPS\n
Private wallet data is stored in the application’s private storage. Backups contain sensitive wallet information and should be kept in a secure location. Never share a wallet backup or private keys with anyone.\n
\n
NETWORK\n
The application supports Bitcoin Mainnet and Bitcoin Signet. The active network is selected in Sync &amp; Network, and each network keeps separate wallet and blockchain storage.\n
\n
OPEN SOURCE COMPONENT\n
BitcoinJ provides the wallet and Bitcoin protocol functionality used by this application.\n
\n
Use the application responsibly and keep independent backups of your wallet.</string>
